<fpage>4008</fpage>&#x02013;4013.<pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">11904445</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="bib26"><citation citation-type="journal">Tsien, R.Y., and T. Pozzan. <year>1989</year>. Measurements of cytosolic free Ca<sup>2+</sup> with Quin-2. <source>Methods Enzymol.</source> <volume>172</volume>:<fpage>230</fpage>&#x02013;262.<pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">2747529</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="bib27"><citation citation-type="journal">Tsunenari, T., H. Sun, J. Williams, H. Cahill, P. Smallwood, K.-W. Yau, and J. Nathans. <year>2003</year>. Structure-function analysis of the bestrophin family of anion channels. <source>J. Biol. Chem.</source> <volume>278</volume>:<fpage>41114</fpage>&#x02013;41125.<pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">12907679</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="bib28"><citation citation-type="journal">Woodhull, A.M. <year>1973</year>. Ionic blockage of sodium channels in nerve. <source>J. Gen. Physiol.</source> <volume>61</volume>:<fpage>687</fpage>&#x02013;708.<pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">4541078</pub-id></citation></ref></ref-list></back></article>